1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,504
Your phone, in Hyderabad. You tap send.

2
00:00:02,774 --> 00:00:05,611
To a computer, a photo is only ones and zeros.

3
00:00:05,881 --> 00:00:08,100
Then your phone locks it. It is encrypted.

4
00:00:08,370 --> 00:00:11,399
If anyone tries to look, they find nothing. Only noise.

5
00:00:11,669 --> 00:00:14,144
Now it is cut into about 2,000 packets.

6
00:00:15,464 --> 00:00:19,389
Every packet gets a label: where it is going, where it came from, and its number.

7
00:00:19,659 --> 00:00:22,283
Then radio waves carry them to a mobile tower.

8
00:00:22,403 --> 00:00:24,088
Its antennas catch the signal.

9
00:00:24,358 --> 00:00:28,945
A box at the bottom turns it into light, and sends it down a glass cable, under the street.

10
00:00:29,065 --> 00:00:31,540
And then, it has to cross an entire ocean.
